status GREEN on what this lap proves -- crushed_index_witness GREEN, its control 43 of 43, geode_libraries_witness GREEN, plus session_roster_agree, index_row_bound, ascii_document, prose_register and qa_report_card each GREEN, and five QA grades at B or better (98, 100, 91, 87, 85). The cold roster receipt is void by tree_moved, my own fault for editing while it ran; the full staged hot pass is the send check and its counts ride in the commit body. Two reds stand unclosed and both are named: stash_record's unlanded=2, which the parked lap above closes, and the roster's own summary red. This lap's finding stays unbooked for want of a lawful REDS row.
recommend keep-going -- recover stash@{0}, this seat's lap parked at the 20260909.092435 open, since stash_record reds every pass until its two logs land; it touches different rows of docs-geode/README.md, so diff rather than apply blind. Its two REDS shelves also make room on the pin for this lap's finding.
